 .. Check that `typeIR'^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `[ _/1 ]`.
 .. Let `[typeIR]` be `typeIR'^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Group setTypeIR: `bound` and `SET < [typeIR] >`

  ... Check that <<nestable_set, `typeIR` can be used in a set type>>.
  ... Check that <<Type_wf, `bound |- typeIR`>> holds.
