--
        * Let `_ typeIR _ _^?^` be `parameterTypeIR`
--
+
for each `parameterTypeIR` in `parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Check that <<nestable_externmethod, `typeIR` can be used in an extern method type>>, for each `typeIR` in `typeIR^{asterisk}^`.
   .... Check that <<Type_wf, `bound |- typeIR~ret~`>> holds.
