. Else if let `PARSER_APPLY ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ )` be `routineTypeIR`:
 .. Group parserApplyMethodTypeIR: `bound` and `PARSER_APPLY ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ )`

  ... Check that <<ParameterTypes_wf, `bound |- parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^`>> holds.
  ... Let `_^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_`, `_^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_`, `_^?^^{asterisk}^` be the list of `_^?^`, and `typeIR^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR`, obtained by repeating:
