  ... Check that <<Sub_impl, `typeIR''''''` can be implicitly cast to `typeIR~b~`>>.
  ... The relation holds.
. If let `defaultTypeIR` be `typeIR''''''`:
 .. Group default: `DEFAULT` and `typeIR'''''''`

  ... Check that `$is_defaultable_typeIR(typeIR''''''')`.
