    ..... Else if `...` is not in `expression~e~^{asterisk}^`:
     ...... Let `expression''^{asterisk}^` be `$rev_<expression>(expression~e~^{asterisk}^)`.
     ...... Check that `expression''^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `_ :: _`.
     ...... Let `expression' :: expression~e_h_rev~^{asterisk}^` be `expression''^{asterisk}^`.
     ...... Check that `expression'` has type `defaultExpression`.
