--
        * Let `argumentIR` be the result of <<Argument_ok, typing `argument`, under cursor `p'` and typing context `TC'`>>
--
+
for each `argument` in `argument^{asterisk}^`.
   .... <<RoutineType_ok, `p' TC' |- routineTargetIR < typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^ > ( argumentIR^{asterisk}^ ) : routineTypeIR < # tid~inserted~^{asterisk}^ > ( # id~default~^{asterisk}^ )`>>.
   .... Let `tid~infer~^{asterisk}^` be `tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ ++ tid~inserted~^{asterisk}^`.
