. Else if let `namedType . APPLY ( argumentList ) ;` be `statement`:
 .. Group directApplicationStatement: `p'`, `TC'`, `f'`, and `namedType . APPLY ( argumentList ) ;`

  ... Let `expressionIR # ( typeIR~object~ _ )` be the result of <<Expr_ok, typing `namedType ( )`, under cursor `p'` and typing context `TC'`>>.
