 .. Let `routineTargetIR` be the result of <<RoutineTarget_ok, typing `expression`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC`>>.
 .. Result in the typed routine target `routineTargetIR`.

relation RoutineType_ok: `p`, `TC`, `routineTargetIR''`, `typeArgumentIR''^{asterisk}^`, and `argumentIR''^{asterisk}^`

