  ... Let `?(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)` be `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)'^?^`.
  ... Check that `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)` has type `(rid, actionTypeIR, id*)`.
  ... Let `(rid, actionTypeIR, id~default~^{asterisk}^)` be `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)`.
  ... Check that <<RoutineType_wf, `$bound(p, TC) |- actionTypeIR`>> holds.
