  ... Let `(routineTypeDefIR, tid*)` be `$specialize_routineTypeDef(routineTypeDefIR, typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^)`.
  ... Check that `(routineTypeDefIR, tid*)` has type `(functionTypeIR, tid*)`.
