  ... Let `bound` be <<union_set, the union of the sets `$bound(p, TC)` and `{ tid~impl~^{asterisk}^ }`>>.
  ... Check that <<RoutineType_wf, `bound |- functionTypeIR`>> holds.
  ... Result in `functionTypeIR`, `tid~impl~^{asterisk}^`, and `id~default~^{asterisk}^`.
. If let `typedExpressionIR~base~ . nameIR` be `routineTargetIR''`:
