  ... If `argumentIR''^{asterisk}^` matches pattern `[]`:
   .... Group typedExpressionIR-nameIR-builtin-method-minmax-SizeIn-BitsBytes: `p`, `TC`, `typedExpressionIR~base~ . nameIR`, `[ ]`, and `[ ]`

    ..... Check that `nameIR` is in `["minSizeInBits", "minSizeInBytes", "maxSizeInBits", "maxSizeInBytes"]`.
    ..... Let `methodTypeIR` be `BUILTIN_METHOD ( [ ] ) -> INT`.
