relation Call_ok: `p`, `TC`, `routineTypeIR`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, `tid~infer'~^{asterisk}^`, `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `id~default'~^{asterisk}^`

. If let `FUNCTION ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~ret~` be `routineTypeIR`:
