for each `typeIR^?^` in `typeIR^?^^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Let `typeArgumentIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^` be `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^ ++ typeIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^`.
  ... Let `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~`, obtained by repeating:
