relation ConstructorType_ok: `p`, `TC`, `prefixedNameIR`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`

. Group : `p`, `TC`, `prefixedNameIR`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`

