for each `tid~infer~` in `tid~infer~^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Check that `typeIR'^?^` matches pattern `(_)`, for each `typeIR'^?^` in `typeIR'^?^^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Let `typeIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `typeIR~inferred~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
    * Let `?typeIR~inferred~` be `typeIR'^?^`
--
+
for each `typeIR'^?^` in `typeIR'^?^^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Let `typeArgumentIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^` be `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^ ++ typeIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Let `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^` be the list of `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~`, obtained by repeating:
+
--
    * Let `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~` be `$subst_parameterType(inference, parameterTypeIR~aligned~)`
--
+
for each `parameterTypeIR~aligned~` in `parameterTypeIR~aligned~^{asterisk}^`.
 .. Let `typeIR~object_inferred~` be `$subst_type(inference, typeIR~object~)`.
 .. Let `constructorTypeIR~inferred~` be `CONSTRUCTOR ( parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~object_inferred~`.
 .. Check that <<ConstructorType_wf, `$bound(GLOBAL, TC) |- constructorTypeIR~inferred~`>> holds.
 .. Check that `$instantiable(GLOBAL, TC, instctxt, typeIR~object_inferred~)`.
 .. Let `argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^` be the result of <<Call_convention_ok, checking the calling convention of `argumentIR^{asterisk}^` applied to parameter types `parameterTypeIR~aligned_inferred~^{asterisk}^`, under cursor `BLOCK`, typing context `TC`, and action context `NOACTION`>>.
 .. Result in `typeIR~object_inferred~`, `typeArgumentIR~inferred~^{asterisk}^`, and `argumentIR~cast~^{asterisk}^`.
. Group non-package: `cursor'`, `TC`, `instctxt`, `constructorTypeIR`, `typeArgumentIR^{asterisk}^`, `tid~infer~^{asterisk}^`, `argumentIR^{asterisk}^`, and `id~default~^{asterisk}^`

 .. Let `CONSTRUCTOR ( parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^ ) -> typeIR~object~` be `constructorTypeIR`.
 .. Check that `$is_package_object_typeIR(<<canon, the canonicalized form of typeIR~object~>>)`.
 .. Let `parameterTypeIR~non_default~^{asterisk}^` be `$filter_default_parameters(parameterTypeIR^{asterisk}^, id~default~^{asterisk}^)`.
